 destination and get matched in a group chat with travelers visiting at the same time.\n- AI-powered recommendations – Get personalized activity and venue suggestions based on your location and interests.\n- In-app messaging & group chats – Connect with travelers before and during your trip.\n\nPremium Features (Nomadtable Plus) \n- See the full list of nearby travelers – Find everyone nearby, not just a limited selection.\n- See who viewed your profile – See which nearby travelers check out your profile.\n- Boost your profile – Appear near the top of the nearby travelers list.\n- Unlimited AI activity suggestions – Unlock all AI-powered recommendations for meetups and activities.\n- Full visibility of overlapping travelers – See the complete list of travelers visiting your future destinations.\n\nWhy Nomadtable?\n- Real-time solo traveler meetups – Instantly connect with other travelers right now and join real-time activities happening near you.\n- Safe & verified connections – Optional profile verification helps ensure genuine meetups with real travelers.\n- Future trip planning made easy – Input your next destination and chat with others who overlap dates with you\n\nGet Started in Seconds!\n1. Sign up & set your profile (age, home country, languages spoken, travel interests).\n2. See who's nearby or join a future trip group chat.\n3. Start meeting fellow solo travelers today!\n\nDownload Nomadtable now & never explore alone again!\n\nTerms of Use: https://terms.nomadtable.app\nPrivacy Policy: https://privacypolicy.nomadtable.app", "minimumOsVersion": "15.1", "contentAdvisoryRating": "17+", "trackCensoredName": "nomadtable: travel friends", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/nomadtable-travel-friends/id6736921913?uo=4", "averageUserRating": 4.55187, "artistId": 1773858399, "artistName": "Nomadtable Inc.", "userRatingCount": 453}]}